---
layout: base.njk
description: Shareable DVD and Blu-ray style menus for Jellyfin, in public-domain JSON.
---
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Community catalogue</p>
    <h1>The disc menu is <em>back</em>. For your own library.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Rediscover the "Play Movie / Scene Selection / Special Features" screen. Each menu here is a small public-domain file for a film or series. The
    <a href="https://github.com/peppy6582/jellydisc">Disc Menus plugin for Jellyfin</a> matches it to the right title in your library by its TMDB, IMDb or TVDB id.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="{{ '/menus/' | url }}">Browse {{ catalogue.count }} menu{{ '' if catalogue.count == 1 else 's' }}</a>
    <a class="button ghost" href="{{ '/submit/' | url }}">Add yours</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="fan" aria-label="Previews of menus in the catalogue">
    {% for e in catalogue.entries %}{% if loop.index <= 3 %}<a href="{{ ('/' + e.page) | url }}" aria-label="{{ e.title }}"><img src="{{ ('/' + e.thumb) | url }}" alt="" width="640" height="360"></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<h2>How it works</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="6" width="28" height="28" rx="6"/><path d="M20 12v13m0 0l-5-5m5 5l5-5M13 30h14"/></svg>
    <strong>Pick and download</strong>
    A menu for a title you own. It's one small <code>.menu.json</code> file.
  </li>
  <li>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8l3 4h13a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v14a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3z"/><path d="M20 17v9m0-9l-3 3m3-3l3 3"/></svg>
    <strong>Drop it in</strong>
    Put it in the plugin's menus folder, or install it from the plugin's Menu Catalogue page.
  </li>
  <li>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="8" width="30" height="20" rx="4"/><path d="M17 14v8l7-4z"/><path d="M13 33h14"/></svg>
    <strong>Press Disc Menu</strong>
    Open the title in Jellyfin. The plugin links the extras for you.
  </li>
</ol>
<p class="note">Menus describe layout and structure only. Backgrounds come from your own server or the film's TMDB backdrop; some menus can use art files you supply, and those are labelled <em>bring your own art</em>. The pictures on this site are generated placeholders, not the real look.</p>

<h2>On the shelf</h2>
<ul class="cards">
{% for e in catalogue.entries %}{% if loop.index <= 6 %}{% include "card.njk" %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="actions"><a class="button ghost" href="{{ '/menus/' | url }}">See all menus</a></p>
